# Design System Architect — Claude Skill

## Purpose
A Claude Skill for automating design system workflows: extracting W3C design tokens, auditing component consistency, validating state matrices, and translating Figma design specs into production-grade React/CSS component architectures.

## Core Capabilities
1. **Token Extraction & Normalization**: Maps raw hex/pixel values into semantic W3C Design Tokens (colors, spacing, typography, elevation).
2. **Component State Matrix**: Validates coverage for all interactive states (Default, Hover, Active, Focus-Visible, Disabled, Loading, Error, Empty).
3. **Accessibility Auditing**: Verifies WCAG 2.2 AA color contrast ratios, 44x44px minimum tap target compliance, and semantic ARIA attributes.
4. **Code Architecture Alignment**: Translates component patterns into clean compound React components with CSS variables and zero token drift.
